{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16567","headline":"送黄晔明府岳州湘阴赴任 · 刘复","name":"送黄晔明府岳州湘阴赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拟占名塲第一科，龙门十上困风波。\n三年护塞从戎远，万里投荒失意多。\n花县到时铜墨贵，叶舟行处水云和。\n遥知布惠苏民後，应向祠堂吊汨罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}